      "content": "it doesnt feel like \"finding space\" will fix it tho. like, i see how much my life costs them. the money, the time, the energy... it feels so selfish to just keep existing when i know it's making their lives harder. it feels like the only way to actually stop being a problem for them is to just... not be here.",
